# Large Dataset Exclusions
# Note: GitHub enforces a strict 100MB per-file upload limit.
# data/transactions.csv is ~477MB (Full PaySim Kaggle dataset) and must be kept local.
# data/paysim_sample.csv (~349KB) is retained for immediate cloud deployment.
data/transactions.csv
data/*.zip
data/*.tar.gz
